repository-code: "https://github.com/Omodaka9375/memochain"
url: "https://omodaka9375.github.io/memochain/"
abstract: >-
  Mina-style constant-size memory for LLMs: the whole history of a
  document collection or chat log collapses into a fixed 22 KB state,
  updated one document at a time in O(1), with a receipt chain (or a
  full SP1 zkVM proof) that makes every memory write verifiable.
keywords:
  - language models
  - memory
  - fast weights
  - zero-knowledge proofs
  - verifiable computation
